n-US","title":"The Lost Patient","overview":"The 19 years old Thomas wakes up in a hospital after three years in a coma. He doesn't remember anything. The psychologist Anna tells him that his family has been murdered and that he is the only survivor of the massacre while his sister Laura is still missing."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Thomas, 19 ans, se réveille à l’hôpital après trois ans de coma, sans aucun souvenir de ce qui lui est arrivé. Il est le seul survivant de sa famille, qui a été assassinée, à l’exception de sa sœur Laura portée disparue. Le jeune homme tente, avec l’aide de la psychologue Anna Kieffer, de reconstituer ses souvenirs fragmentés. Dans l’environnement étrangement menaçant de l’hôpital surgissent, de son labyrinthe mental, des images qui masquent un terrible secret."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tL0xieVl5ms5EO6EuzxC6xFhPyg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pHjSH9Fxf7gYzYBZNZJ4ZLNxk17.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1006917,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tHwGtD4zT0IhKdc2JQNxHAJFGWn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tHwGtD4zT0IhKdc2JQNxHAJFGWn.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tHwGtD4zT0IhKdc2JQNxHAJFGWn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tHwGtD4zT0IhKdc2JQNxHAJFGWn.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440}]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tL0xieVl5ms5EO6EuzxC6xFhPyg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tL0xieVl5ms5EO6EuzxC6xFhPyg.jpg","language":"fr","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url"